<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59330" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοσμο-ποιέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make the world</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.719
			</span></i> d, <i><span class="en">
				877
			</span></i> c (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.112
			</span></i> (ap.<i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Mixt.</u>
				225.2
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.79
			</span></i> P. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>frame a system</i> or <i>theory of the world</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Metaph.</u>
				1091a18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cael.</u>
				301a13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἕκαστον τῶν ἀστέρων</span>
			<i>assert</i> them <i>to be worlds,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Placit.
				2.13.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>bestow order upon, organize</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὕλην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					270
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
